}
?>
```

To make the page dynamic, you could add JavaScript to change the image URL when it's time for sunset. This would require modifying the above code slightly:
```
<?php
// Set variables for sunrise and sunset times in your location (adjust as needed)
$dayrise = "06:30";
$daysunset = "18:00";

// Get current hour from server time zone
$currentHour = date('G');

// Determine if it's daytime or nighttime
if ($currentHour >= $dayrise && $currentHour <= $daysunset) {
  // It's daytime - set color to bright yellow
  echo "<div id='sun' style='width:50%; height:50%; background-color:yellow;'></div>";
} else {
  // It's nighttime - set color to red and orange swirls and change image URL
